The primers used for real-time qPCR are

HOXB9 : F: 5’-ACAAAGAGAGGCCGGATCAA-3’,

R: 5’-TCATTTTCATCCGCCGGTTC-3’;

ODC1 : F: 5’-ATGTTGCATCAGCTTTCACG-3’,

R: 5’-ACTCTCCCAGGCACAAGACA-3’;

GAPDH : F: 5’-GGAGCGAGATCCCTCCAAAAT-3’,

R: 5’-GGCTGTTGTCATACTTCTCATGG-3’;

Tissues or cells were lysed using a strong RIPA buffer (1× PBS, pH 7.4, 0.5% sodium deoxycholate, 1% NP40, 0.1% SDS) containing cocktail inhibitor (Roche Basel, Switzerland) and PhosSTOP (Roche Basel, Switzerland).

